Yeah, sometimes--
Twice he does that.


00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:49.490
He know what...


00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:50.840
Yeah, and you see...


00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:53.160
EDWARDS: My girlfriend
and my kid are coming out here.


00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:55.010
And her parents are bringing us
a camper


00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:57.330
so that we can have
our own place.


00:22:57.340 --> 00:22:59.850
Hopefully there's a site.


00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:01.340
They got little swings
for your kid.


00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:02.340
Cool.


00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:06.760
So is there anyplace
available right now?


00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:08.540
WOMAN:
No, I'm full.


00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:09.810
I don't do
a waiting list.


00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:12.300
You can always
check back.


00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:14.300
Just check with me,
you know, frequently
and see,


00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:16.640
but I just don't have
