see the guys.


00:25:23.180 --> 00:25:24.180
It's not
a meeting about--


00:25:24.180 --> 00:25:26.180
But it's an invitation
just to pray


00:25:26.190 --> 00:25:28.490
and read scripture
and sing some hymns.


00:25:28.490 --> 00:25:29.330
Hello!
Hi.


00:25:29.820 --> 00:25:31.320
I'm Pastor Reinke
from next door.


00:25:31.320 --> 00:25:32.320
Yes.
Ok.


00:25:32.330 --> 00:25:34.830
Hey, I have
an invitation.


00:25:34.830 --> 00:25:36.090
[Man, indistinct]


00:25:36.080 --> 00:25:37.360
Yes, yes, yes.


00:25:37.360 --> 00:25:39.860
Well, why do you got all
them trash over there?


00:25:39.870 --> 00:25:42.380
Well, um...


00:25:42.370 --> 00:25:43.370
No, don't explain.


00:25:43.370 --> 00:25:45.370
Don't distract it.


00:25:45.370 --> 00:25:46.370
Ok.


00:25:46.370 --> 00:25:48.870
Everybody says
they're homeless.


00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:50.380
Homeless my ass.


00:25:50.380 --> 00:25:51.880
They're making
big money.


00:25:51.880 --> 00:25:53.390
Actually some of
these people aren't,


00:25:53.380 --> 00:25:56.880
and I had one gentleman
in the parking lot
just last week


00:25:56.880 --> 00:25:59.380
who just lost his home
in South Carolina.


00:25:59.390 --> 00:26:00.890
That's his problem.


00:26:00.890 --> 00:26:02.400
It is his problem,


00:26:02.390 --> 00:26:04.390
and I'm trying to
help him is all.


00:26:04.890 --> 00:26:06.390
So...ok, ok.
Thanks.


00:26:06.390 --> 00:26:07.390
Thank you.


00:26:07.390 --> 00:26:08.390
Good night.
God bless.


00:26:10.980 --> 00:26:13.980
Here's a gentlemen
just called them trash.


00:26:13.980 --> 00:26:16.480
Not to judge people
by appearances,


00:26:16.900 --> 00:26:21.570
a man with no teeth,
living with his daughter,


00:26:21.570 --> 00:26:25.880
calling other people
who have needs trash.


00:26:27.380 --> 00:26:28.880
MAN: Pastor Reinke!


00:26:28.880 --> 00:26:31.210
How we doing?


00:26:31.220 --> 00:26:33.060
I have to admit,
sometimes I do
have some concerns.


00:26:33.050 --> 00:26:34.470
My college kids are
home for the summer,


00:26:34.470 --> 00:26:36.050
and so I have
a 20-year-old daughter,


00:26:36.560 --> 00:26:38.930
so my anxiety levels
go up.


00:26:38.930 --> 00:26:40.350
JAY:
We're not quite sure,


00:26:40.340 --> 00:26:42.260
