the parking lot
until 8:00 at night.


00:26:44.180 --> 00:26:45.140
Ok.


00:26:45.680 --> 00:26:48.850
I think that would give
some comfort to, um...


00:26:49.350 --> 00:26:52.150
to the neighbors.


00:26:52.160 --> 00:26:52.950
Yes.


00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:54.440
The one other thing is


00:26:54.440 --> 00:26:55.440
