01:27:31.070 --> 01:27:37.380
If--If we are not heard
at the planning and zoning,


01:27:37.380 --> 01:27:44.880
then I think
the only options
will be to close...


01:27:47.390 --> 01:27:49.390
to engage
in civil disobedience


01:27:49.840 --> 01:27:52.390
and simply ignore them.


01:27:52.680 --> 01:27:53.930
Well, kicking people
out of a church


01:27:53.930 --> 01:27:55.430
isn't gonna change
the fact


01:27:55.430 --> 01:27:56.930
that there's still
an oil boom going on.


01:27:56.930 --> 01:27:59.770
It's not gonna stop
the people from coming.


01:27:59.770 --> 01:28:01.650
You know?


01:28:01.650 --> 01:28:03.520
People are under
the assumption that,


01:28:03.520 --> 01:28:06.020
well, if everything
were to just stop
tomorrow,


01:28:06.030 --> 01:28:08.030
life would go back
to the way it was.


01:28:08.530 --> 01:28:10.040
And that's not true.


01:28:10.030 --> 01:28:11.990
JAY: No, I--Yeah.


01:28:12.000 --> 01:28:14.370
I don't know
what to say.


01:28:14.370 --> 01:28:19.180
I mean, it could
possibly go
in our favor.


01:28:24.010 --> 01:28:26.880
Under communications,


01:28:26.880 --> 01:28:29.180
and probably some
in the audience


01:28:29.180 --> 01:28:31.430
are here this evening
for this,


01:28:31.430 --> 01:28:35.220
but we had a special
permitted use application


01:28:35.220 --> 01:28:39.560
for Concordia Lutheran Church
to house people,


01:28:39.560 --> 01:28:44.060
and after a special meeting,
a decision was made


01:28:44.060 --> 01:28:46.560
to withdraw that application


01:28:46.570 --> 01:28:49.070
or take that off the agenda
for this evening,


01:28:49.070 --> 01:28:51.740
and I would ask Kent
to please expound


01:28:51.740 --> 01:28:54.250
on what transpired there.


01:28:54.240 --> 01:28:57.120
KENT: The fire chief
looked through


01:28:57.130 --> 01:28:57.970
his ordinance and codes,


01:28:58.490 --> 01:29:00.990
and based on the way
the setup is now,


01:29:01.000 --> 01:29:03.090
the building does not have
a sprinkler system.


01:29:03.080 --> 01:29:05.630
You can't have sleeping
facilities in the hallways.


01:29:05.630 --> 01:29:11.920
You have to deem
specific sleeping areas
and meet fire codes.


01:29:11.920 --> 01:29:14.810
So therefore
it was deemed incomplete.


01:29:14.810 --> 01:29:16.230
MAN: Ok.


01:29:16.230 --> 01:29:18.730
So if there's other things
that you want to stay for,


01:29:18.730 --> 01:29:20.650
you're certainly welcome
to stay,


01:29:20.650 --> 01:29:22.010
but if that's the specific
reason that you're here,


01:29:22.020 --> 01:29:25.080
we cannot act on it, ok?


01:29:25.070 --> 01:29:28.570
Mr. Chairman,
will you take
any public...


01:29:28.570 --> 01:29:31.070
No. At this time,
I really can't


01:29:31.080 --> 01:29:33.090
because we aren't going
to be acting on it.


01:29:33.080 --> 01:29:36.580
So therefore we won't be taking
any public comments
at this time.


01:29:36.580 --> 01:29:41.950
Ok, we will move on to our
public hearings this evening.


01:29:46.010 --> 01:29:50.790
JAY: I do not know
any way around our closing


01:29:50.800 --> 01:29:52.720
by the 12th of September.


01:29:52.720 --> 01:29:56.360
And that just means essentially
there's no options


01:29:56.350 --> 01:29:58.220
in terms of sleeping here.


01:29:58.220 --> 01:29:59.600
And I just don't get it.


01:29:59.610 --> 01:30:01.110
I have to tell you
I don't get it.


01:30:01.110 --> 01:30:02.030
I don't get it.


01:30:02.020 --> 01:30:03.940
It makes no sense to me
at all.


01:30:03.940 --> 01:30:06.110
MAN: You would think
the city as a whole


01:30:06.610 --> 01:30:08.060
would be trying
to help people


01:30:08.060 --> 01:30:09.860
that's trying to
help themselves.


01:30:09.870 --> 01:30:11.710
There's, like,
you're in this room.


01:30:12.280 --> 01:30:14.280
Well, they're trying
to put their foot
on top of your head


01:30:14.290 --> 01:30:15.290
and drown you,
you know?


01:30:15.290 --> 01:30:17.300
Just get them
on out of here,
you know?


01:30:17.290 --> 01:30:18.790
They don't deserve
a chance.


01:30:18.790 --> 01:30:20.290
Everyone
deserves a chance.
This is America.


01:30:20.290 --> 01:30:22.240
This is what
this country was
founded on, you know.


01:30:22.240 --> 01:30:24.740
Helping your neighbor,
you know,


01:30:24.750 --> 01:30:26.670
just being good people,


01:30:26.670 --> 01:30:29.060
and Williston's not
seeing that message


01:30:29.050 --> 01:30:30.050
when they're basically
saying, you know,


01:30:30.050 --> 01:30:31.050
we're homeless.


01:30:31.550 --> 01:30:33.550
I'm not homeless.
I'm just struggling.


01:30:33.560 --> 01:30:35.430
I have a home
in Kentucky.


01:30:35.420 --> 01:30:38.840
I just want
a better life.


01:30:38.840 --> 01:30:41.260
I don't know
what else to do.


01:30:52.610 --> 01:30:56.790
What you do is something
that cannot be done


01:30:56.780 --> 01:30:58.280
by average people.


01:31:00.700 --> 01:31:03.120
JAY, VOICE-OVER:
To be human is to serve


01:31:03.120 --> 01:31:05.620
and to let the neighbor
change your life.


01:31:05.870 --> 01:31:08.170
I don't think we have
anymore people like you


01:31:08.170 --> 01:31:09.670
in this town.


01:31:09.680 --> 01:31:11.180
If we did, it would be
a lot better place.


01:31:14.180 --> 01:31:16.130
Thanks, you guys.
It's really been good.


01:31:16.130 --> 01:31:19.130
It's really
been good.


01:31:19.130 --> 01:31:21.180
JAY, VOICE-OVER:
I will not give in to despair


01:31:21.190 --> 01:31:24.200
because hopeless
should never win


01:31:24.190 --> 01:31:27.020
and hopeless is a lie.


01:31:56.310 --> 01:31:58.060
JAY, VOICE-OVER:
I never really felt


01:31:58.060 --> 01:32:00.070
like I belonged in Williston.


01:32:00.060 --> 01:32:05.310
I mean, the church, yeah,
but as a community, not really.


01:32:05.310 --> 01:32:09.310
Now I have ever reason
to remember


01:32:09.320 --> 01:32:11.330
why I don't belong here.


01:32:25.280 --> 01:32:28.080
JAY, VOICE-OVER: I was the one
who always preached


01:32:28.090 --> 01:32:31.460
serving others
to the overnighters.


01:32:31.460 --> 01:32:33.930
Serve the community,
serve the neighbors.


01:32:33.930 --> 01:32:39.300
And...in some of
the most fundamental ways,


01:32:39.300 --> 01:32:43.280
the relationship to my family,
I didn't serve.


01:32:45.190 --> 01:32:50.200
And I neglected the community
I was given and my family,


01:32:50.190 --> 01:32:53.730
and I have...
I have hurt them terribly.


01:32:58.950 --> 01:33:05.290
The private me distances itself
from the public me,


01:33:05.290 --> 01:33:07.070
and I can believe the public me


01:33:07.080 --> 01:33:10.090
because sometimes it looks
very good.


01:33:10.080 --> 01:33:16.920
But the private me...
has become something else.


01:33:19.920 --> 01:33:22.920
This is a hard thing to say.


01:33:23.430 --> 01:33:28.440
But in my life, I have struggled
with same-sex attraction.


01:33:28.430 --> 01:33:30.810
And I've acted on that.


01:33:34.690 --> 01:33:38.700
It's true.
I'm the one who's broken.


01:34:06.470 --> 01:34:08.930
So yesterday
I went for a drive,


01:34:08.940 --> 01:34:10.450
looking for a place
where you and I


01:34:10.440 --> 01:34:12.440
could sit and talk,


01:34:12.440 --> 01:34:14.440
where it has
no positive memories,


01:34:14.940 --> 01:34:16.440
where it's ugly


01:34:16.950 --> 01:34:21.290
so we could
have a conversation
and then leave.


01:34:26.160 --> 01:34:28.660
I have to make
confession.


01:34:33.550 --> 01:34:36.470
Terry Forke is gonna come
probably in a week or two


01:34:36.470 --> 01:34:39.420
and ask me if certain
allegations are true,


01:34:39.970 --> 01:34:42.470
and they are.


01:34:49.930 --> 01:34:51.430
Who?


01:34:51.430 --> 01:34:53.930
There's a man
who's blackmailed me...


01:34:55.430 --> 01:34:56.820
and...


01:35:17.590 --> 01:35:22.590
I've put you
in a horrible...
horrible spot.


01:35:37.610 --> 01:35:42.610
JAY: My thoughts and desires
have been soiled by sin.


01:35:45.230 --> 01:35:49.120
I have broken knowingly and
willingly the sixth commandment,


01:35:49.120 --> 01:35:51.490
"You shall not commit adultery,"


01:35:51.490 --> 01:35:55.070
and have violated my vocation
as husband, father, neighbor,


01:35:55.080 --> 01:35:57.550
Christian, and pastor.


01:35:59.580 --> 01:36:02.080
I have served my own will.


01:36:02.080 --> 01:36:04.630
I have led others
into temptation.


01:36:04.640 --> 01:36:08.600
I've sinned against the members
of this entire community


01:36:08.590 --> 01:36:11.560
to whom I have spoken publicly
as a servant of truth.


01:36:11.560 --> 01:36:13.560
I have now tempted this
community to doubt that truth


01:36:14.060 --> 01:36:16.480
and to regard the testimony
of God's word


01:36:16.480 --> 01:36:19.480
and the ministry
of this congregation as a lie.


01:36:22.690 --> 01:36:25.330
I have sinned against
my faithful wife, Andrea,


01:36:25.320 --> 01:36:28.320
who has given her life to me
and to our children.


01:36:28.330 --> 01:36:32.370
And I have exposed her
to heartache and shame.


01:36:32.830 --> 01:36:36.370
I have abused the trust
of my beloved children,


01:36:36.370 --> 01:36:38.370
who want me only to love
and serve their mother


01:36:38.370 --> 01:36:41.620
and to lead a godly life.


01:36:47.960 --> 01:36:51.710
You have trusted me,
and I have betrayed your trust.


01:36:53.220 --> 01:36:58.720
I have resigned
my position as a pastor.


01:37:01.480 --> 01:37:05.490
I've got to leave, but look
what I've done to my family.


01:37:12.450 --> 01:37:14.450
They're the victims here.


01:37:24.670 --> 01:37:27.680
JAY, VOICE-OVER:
So now I'm without a job.


01:37:27.670 --> 01:37:31.890
And I'm where
the overnighters were.


01:37:33.390 --> 01:37:35.890
I'm 57 years old,


01:37:35.890 --> 01:37:39.390
and I'm not quite sure
where to start.


01:38:05.260 --> 01:38:09.770
[Machinery banging]


01:38:34.990 --> 01:38:38.000
