you and me ?


01:38:47.000 --> 01:38:49.500
? Just tumble in the breeze ?


01:38:49.500 --> 01:38:55.000
? Lighter than a feather,
all together separately ?


01:38:58.510 --> 01:39:01.010
? That's how
it's supposed to be ?


01:39:01.010 --> 01:39:06.520
? No matter where they wander
from post to in between ?


01:39:06.520 --> 01:39:08.600
MAN: My name is Digi.


01:39:08.600 --> 01:39:10.600
I'm from Congo, DRC.


01:39:10.610 --> 01:39:13.580
My name is Michael.
I come from Philadelphia.


01:39:13.580 --> 01:39:15.030
My name is Darrell.


01:39:15.030 --> 01:39:17.040
Although I'm an original native
of North Dakota,


01:39:17.030 --> 01:39:19.360
I came from Peoria, Illinois.


01:39:19.360 --> 01:39:21.700
My name is Dia.
I'm from Maryland.


01:39:22.200 --> 01:39:25.030
And originally
I'm from Baghdad, Iraq.


01:39:25.040 --> 01:39:28.210
My name's Dennis.
I'm from Milwaukee, Wisconsin.


01:39:28.210 --> 01:39:30.520
Chris. Detroit, Michigan.


01:39:30.510 --> 01:39:34.340
My name is Estime.
I'm from Congo, Brazzaville.


01:39:34.350 --> 01:39:38.140
My name is Tyler Lokvanier,
and I'm from Billings, Montana.


01:39:38.130 --> 01:39:40.520
My name's Akton,
from Ghana.


01:39:40.520 --> 01:39:43.850
? And now the moment's gone ?


01:39:46.860 --> 01:39:49.860
? It keeps you hanging on ?


01:39:49.860 --> 01:39:55.860
? Until the silence signaling
the breaking of the dawn ?


01:39:55.870 --> 01:40:01.880
? Is shattered by the sirens
singing sacrificial songs ?


01:40:04.880 --> 01:40:07.890
? The silent are the strong ?


01:40:34.910 --> 01:40:37.920
